@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+`/src/billing.ts` is the authoritative implementation source for supported billing rules. It currently exports a refund window of 30 days through `refundWindowDays`.
+
+For refund questions, use the implemented window but do not infer the date from which it runs, additional eligibility rules, exceptions, or authority to execute a refund. Escalate when those facts are required to answer safely.
+
+No invoice-dispute, correction, or credit policy is established by the current billing implementation. For invoice questions, rely on available project evidence and escalate rather than promising an adjustment or credit.

